Dear ImGui 1.92 compatibility (chantier 8.6) — two mechanical fixes:
1. imgui_extra_math.inl: guard operator*(float, ImVec2) — imgui.h defines
   it itself under IMGUI_DEFINE_MATH_OPERATORS since 1.90.x (its ==/!= and
   unary- neighbours ARE guarded upstream; this one was missed).
2. imgui_node_editor.cpp: ImRect::Floor() was removed from imgui_internal.h;
   replaced by ImFloor on Min/Max at the 8 call sites.
Upstream: thedmd/imgui-node-editor develop @ b302971.

diff --git a/imgui_extra_math.inl b/imgui_extra_math.inl
index 8e2347f..7f445ec 100644
--- a/imgui_extra_math.inl
+++ b/imgui_extra_math.inl
@@ -31,10 +31,12 @@ inline bool operator!=(const ImVec2& lhs, const ImVec2& rhs)
 }
 # endif
 
+# if IMGUI_VERSION_NUM < 19002
 inline ImVec2 operator*(const float lhs, const ImVec2& rhs)
 {
     return ImVec2(lhs * rhs.x, lhs * rhs.y);
 }
+# endif
 
 # if IMGUI_VERSION_NUM < 18955
 inline ImVec2 operator-(const ImVec2& lhs)
